answer1:
$$
\left(e^{-iHt}\right)_{jl} = 
\begin{cases}
e^{-iE_* t} \cdot \dfrac{(-it)^{l - j}}{(l - j)!}, & \text{if } l \geq j \\
0, & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
$$

